<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.87 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   1.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.59 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Sales		   10.86 vs   7.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.92 vs   5.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.26 vs   6.80</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.31 vs   6.73</p>
<p> Sales		   75.58 vs  50.11</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
